        <main>
        <h1>System and Software Description Document for '{{metadata.name}}'</h1>
        <p>
            This document describes the system architecture, components, and software configuration in detail.
            It includes technical specifications, interfaces, and dependencies to provide a comprehensive understanding of the system.
            This description supports validation activities, operational readiness, and compliance with regulatory requirements.  
        </p>
        <section class="page">
        <h2>Table of Contents</h2>
        <nav>
        <ol class="table-of-contents">
            <li><a href="#section_1">System Overview</a></li>
            <li><a href="#section_2">System Components</a></li>
            <li><a href="#section_3">System Modules</a></li>
            <li><a href="#section_4">System Relations</a></li>
